sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Publish a complete version, then discover it without caching
accDescr: A publisher stores and verifies a complete tile version before updating the latest manifest. A client retrieves the uncached manifest and fetches only tiles pinned to its version through CloudFront.
participant P as Publisher
participant S as Private S3 origin
participant E as CloudFront
participant C as Client
P->>S: Write all tiles under version v2
P->>S: Verify complete tile set
P->>S: Update latest manifest to v2
C->>E: Refresh latest manifest
E->>S: Fetch manifest, cache TTLs are zero
S-->>E: Manifest identifies v2
E-->>C: Manifest, browser no-store
C->>C: Pin v2 for this view
C->>E: Request v2 tile URLs
alt Tile is cached
E-->>C: Cached immutable v2 tile
else Cache miss
E->>S: Signed OAC request for v2 tile
S-->>E: v2 tile
E-->>C: Return and cache immutable tile
end
